From d3acd27a9684692d7df558a020219d09ca94d373 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ga=C3=ABl=20Duval?= <gael@murena.io>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:51:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] feat(documenteditor): About in the File menu, title bar
 fit, print title

- About (version and legal notices) moves to the bottom of the File menu
  next to Options, since the left icon rail that held it is gone.
- The file name shows its save state as an icon only when name and
  state do not fit before the search box.
- The Print page title has the size of the other File menu pages.

[branding]

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
